  "description": {
    "ja": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (ja): ハリビユ",
      "source_url": "https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E3%83%8F%E3%83%AA%E3%83%93%E3%83%A6",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 106371579,
      "text": "ハリビユ は、ヒユ科の一年草。熱帯アメリカ原産。南北アメリカ、アフリカ、アジア、オーストラリアなどの熱帯から亜熱帯から暖帯にまで世界中に帰化している。日本では主に東北以南の畑、牧草地、道端、荒地などを中心として夏期に生育する雑草。別名、ハリイヌビユ。"
    },
    "en": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (en): Amaranthus spinosus",
      "source_url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Amaranthus_spinosus",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 1377279994,
      "text": "Amaranthus spinosus, commonly known as the spiny amaranth, spiny pigweed, prickly amaranth or thorny amaranth, is a plant native to the tropical Americas. Spread worldwide as a weed, it is an aggressive invasive species toxic to livestock. It is a serious weed interfering with rice cultivation in Asia."
    },
    "es": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (es): Amaranthus spinosus",
      "source_url": "https://es.wikipedia.org/wiki/Amaranthus_spinosus",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 174419973,
      "text": "Amaranthus spinosus, llamada popularmente atacú del Perú, es una hierba silvestre de la familia de las amarantáceas."
    },
    "fr": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (fr): Amaranthus spinosus",
      "source_url": "https://fr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Amaranthus_spinosus",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 230660042,
      "text": "Amaranthus spinosus, l'amarante épineuse, est une espèce de plantes dicotylédones de la famille des Amaranthaceae, présente dans les régions tropicales et subtropicales."
    },
    "pt": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (pt): Amaranthus spinosus",
      "source_url": "https://pt.wikipedia.org/wiki/Amaranthus_spinosus",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 64611917,
      "text": "Amaranthus spinosus é uma espécie de planta com flor pertencente à família Amaranthaceae."
    },
    "id": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (id): Bayam duri",
      "source_url": "https://id.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bayam_duri",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 29798229,
      "text": "Bayam duri adalah spesies tanaman berbunga dari genus amaranthus termasuk ke dalam suku Amaranthaceae. Nama lain dari tumbuhan ini yaitu bayam kerui (Lampung); senggang cucuk (Sunda); bayam eri, bayam raja, bayam roda, bayam cikron (Jawa); tarnyak duri, tarnyak lakek (Madura); bayam kikihan, bayam siap, kerug pasih (Bali); kedawa mawau, karawa rap-rap, karawa in asu, karowa kawayo (Minahasa); sinau katinting (Makassar); podo maduri ; maijanga, ma hohoru ; baya ; loda."
    }
  },
